The `hodow_cts` crate is a partial rewrite of VK-GL-CTS in Rust. Individual
source files that were derived from VK-GL-CTS retain the original copyright
headers and carry a notice stating that the file was modified, as required by
section 4(b) of the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The specific upstream revision each ported file was derived from is recorded in
`hodow_cts/upstream/COMMIT`, and the unmodified upstream sources for every file
that has been ported are vendored under `hodow_cts/upstream/` so that changes
between upstream revisions can be diffed directly.
